text":"4。此外，已符合《公证法实施令》第38条规定的设施标准。"},{"id":"A36831-zh-00022","doc":"A36831","law_id":"kr-011238-240293-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2683113","source_hash":"2bcc671aeceafacce6ed1732a2777f5b6447a5f309094de9430efb28ed54d110","text":"可验证的支持文件"},{"id":"A36831-zh-00023","doc":"A36831","law_id":"kr-011238-240293-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2683114","source_hash":"6a678e857e2b2b3c4ff3ee68fbf0cdd7734b0fd79fda41cec6a73ed2fd7a6d8d","text":"210厘米×297厘米（报纸 54克/平方米（可回收））"}]}